 "statement": "For E/F_p of odd prime rational order r>=5 with gcd(r,p-1)=1, the monic x-kernel polynomial K of 1+Frobenius satisfies K(x(P))=2y(P)Phi(P)^r for every nonzero rational P, where Phi is the Lauter-Stange EDS normalizer."
